===Suffix===
{{la-suffix-adj|-ālis}}

# {{non-gloss|Suffixed to [[noun]]s or [[numeral]]s creating [[adjective]]s of relationship.}}
#: {{suffixusex|la|anima|t1=breath|-ālis|animālis|t3=animate, living}}
#: {{suffixusex|la|crūra|t1=legs|-ālis|crūrālis|t3=pertaining to the leg, crural}}
#: {{suffixusex|la|pedēs|t1=feet|-ālis|pedālis|t3=pertaining to the foot}}
