#: {{suffixusex|la|nātūra|-ālis|t1=nature|nātūrālis|t3=natural}}
# {{non-gloss|Suffixed to [[adjective]]s creating [[adjective]]s with an [[intensify|intensified]] meaning.}}
#: {{suffixusex|la|aequus|t1=equal in a [[given]] quality; even, level|-ālis|aequālis|t3=equal in every [[respect]], identical in value; uniform, unvarying}}
